<navigation-bar title="每日营养报告" back="{{false}}" color="#2d2623" background="transparent"><view slot="left" class="nav-circle" bindtap="goBack"><view class="back-icon"></view></view><view slot="right" class="share-button" bindtap="share"><view class="share-icon"><view class="share-arrow"></view></view><text>分享</text></view></navigation-bar>
<scroll-view class="report-scroll" scroll-y enhanced show-scrollbar="{{false}}"><view class="page-shell report-page">
  <view class="report-meta"><image src="/assets/baby-avatar-v1.png" mode="aspectFill"></image><view><text class="meta-name">小米</text><text>10个月23天</text></view><view class="date-pill"><text>2024年7月27日</text><view class="calendar-small"></view><view class="drop"></view></view></view>
  <view class="overview-card ui-card"><view class="overview-score"><text>今日饮食评分</text><view><text class="big-score">88</text><text>分</text></view><view class="star-line"><view wx:for="{{[1,2,3,4,5]}}" wx:key="*this" class="star-shape"></view><view class="star-shape off"></view></view><text class="praise-pill">很棒的一天！继续保持哦~</text></view><image src="/assets/baby-eating-focus-v2.png" mode="aspectFill"></image><view class="radar-panel"><view class="radar-title">营养均衡度 <view class="info-icon">i</view></view><view class="radar"><view class="radar-grid large"></view><view class="radar-grid medium"></view><view class="radar-grid small"></view><view class="radar-value"></view><text class="radar-label top">蛋白质</text><text class="radar-label right">碳水</text><text class="radar-label br">脂肪</text><text class="radar-label bl">维生素</text><text class="radar-label left">矿物质</text></view></view></view>
  <view class="intake-card ui-card"><view class="intake-heading"><text class="section-title">营养摄入情况</text><view class="legend"><view><view class="dot good"></view><text>摄入充足</text></view><view><view class="dot warn"></view><text>摄入偏低</text></view><view><view class="dot danger"></view><text>摄入过多</text></view></view></view><view class="intake-grid"><view class="intake-item" wx:for="{{nutrients}}" wx:key="name"><text class="intake-name">{{item.name}}</text><view class="nutrient-symbol">{{item.badge}}</view><view class="intake-ring" style="background: conic-gradient({{item.color}} {{item.value}}%, #f2e9e4 0)"><view>{{item.value}}%</view></view><text class="status-pill {{item.status === '偏低' ? 'warn' : ''}}">{{item.status}}</text></view></view><view class="intake-tip"><view class="bulb"></view><text>今天铁和膳食纤维摄入偏低，建议在明天的饮食中适当补充。</text><view class="chevron"></view></view></view>
  <view class="insight-grid"><view class="insight-card ui-card"><view class="insight-title"><text>今日饮食亮点</text><view class="smile-icon"><view></view></view></view><view class="highlight-row" wx:for="{{highlights}}" wx:key="title"><view class="round-check"><view class="check-icon"></view></view><view><text>{{item.title}}</text><text>{{item.desc}}</text></view></view><image src="/assets/baby-eating-v1.png" mode="aspectFill"></image></view><view class="insight-card ui-card"><view class="insight-title"><text>明日饮食建议</text><view class="recommend-star"></view></view><view class="recommend-row" wx:for="{{recommendations}}" wx:key="title"><view class="recommend-badge {{item.tone}}">{{item.badge}}</view><view><text>{{item.title}}</text><text>{{item.desc}}</text></view></view><view class="recipe-link"><text>查看明日推荐食谱</text><view class="chevron"></view></view></view></view>
  <view class="meal-strip ui-card"><view class="strip-heading"><text class="section-title">今日饮食记录</text><text class="muted">共4餐</text><view bindtap="openRecords"><text>查看全部记录</text><view class="chevron"></view></view></view><view class="strip-meals"><view wx:for="{{['早餐','午餐','加餐','晚餐']}}" wx:key="*this"><view class="meal-dot"></view><text>{{item}}</text><image src="/assets/home-banner.png" mode="aspectFill"></image></view></view></view>
  <view class="streak-card"><image src="/assets/baby-avatar-v1.png" mode="aspectFill"></image><view><text>坚持记录是科学喂养的第一步，爸爸妈妈辛苦啦！</text><text>连续记录 7 天，解锁更多营养分析哦~</text></view><button bindtap="openRecords">去打卡</button></view>
</view></scroll-view>
<app-tabbar active="report" showCamera="{{true}}"></app-tabbar>
